    {
      "source": "Add the given <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "添加给定的<code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">接口</a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method parameter</a> is\nsupported by any registered <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "给定的<a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法参数</a>是否由任何已注册的<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>支持。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the given <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "添加给定的<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Iterate over registered\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a>\nand invoke the one that supports it.",
      "translation": "遍历已注册的 <a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a> 并调用支持它的那个。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves method parameters by delegating to a list of registered\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a>.\nPreviously resolved method parameters are cached for faster lookups.",
      "translation": "通过委托给已注册的`HandlerMethodArgumentResolver`列表来解析方法参数。<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolvers</code></a>。之前解析的方法参数会被缓存以加快查找速度。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Clear the list of configured resolvers and the resolver cache.",
      "translation": "清除已配置的解析器列表和解析器缓存。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a read-only list with the contained resolvers, or an empty list.",
      "translation": "返回包含解析器的只读列表，或返回空列表。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsParameter</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodArgumentResolver` 接口中的 <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsParameter</a></code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodArgumentResolver` 接口中的 `<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">resolveArgument</a>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve.\nThis parameter must have previously been passed to\n<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>\nwhich must have returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须先前已传递给<a href=\"HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回 <code>true</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if no suitable argument resolver is found",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果找不到合适的参数解析器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this resolver supports the supplied parameter;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此解析器支持提供的参数；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - in case of errors with the preparation of argument values",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 在准备参数值时发生错误的情况下",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
